note: hello.vibe — minimal Azra (.vibe) example
note: no brackets anywhere: blocks start with `:` and use 4-space indentation

set greeting to "Hello from Azra!"
say greeting

set items to "sword", "shield", "potion"
for each item in items:
    say "slot:", item

define greet with name:
    say "welcome,", name

greet with "player"
